(7507359, 1197502, 182284, '<td valign="top">I want to thank everyone for the comments and votes. I started out really stronng with a 6.7, it bouced around up and down then it really went south this eve. I just couldn''t watch it go any lower so started working on some of my other photos. I was curious to see how it did and I can''t begin to tell you how awesome it is for me to get a ribbon, I am so excited. I''ve been here for almost a year, submitted my first 100 challenges and now a red ribbon. Thank you so much!! I''m still jumping up and down.</td>', 'I want to thank everyone for the comments and votes. I started out really stronng with a 6.7, it bouced around up and down then it really went south this eve. I just couldn''t watch it go any lower so started working on some of my other photos. I was curious to see how it did and I can''t begin to tell you how awesome it is for me to get a ribbon, I am so excited. I''ve been here for almost a year, submitted my first 100 challenges and now a red ribbon. Thank you so much!! I''m still jumping up and down.', '2017-04-03 03:50:52.000000', NULL, 0),
